# Keep the Docker build context lean. Build context is the repository root for
# the per-service Dockerfiles (core-api, mcp-server, agent-runtime-api). These
# are rebuilt inside the image, so host copies must never leak in.
**/node_modules
node_modules
.git
**/dist
dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
**/coverage
.nx
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.log
